config INPUT_AW8624_HAPTIC
	tristate "Awinic AW8624 haptic driver"
	depends on I2C && OF && GPIOLIB
	help
	  Say Y here if you have the Awinic AW8624 haptic controller (the
	  vibrator on sweet).

	  If unsure, say N.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here.
